    "description": "<p>Zennyo have deep sea-blue scales and fin-like gill structures along the jaw, neck or ribs. Their houses settle near coasts, rivers and flooded caverns, where they serve as healers, navigators and keepers of water rights.</p>\n<p>To a Zennyo, water is memory. They are taught that corruption can be carried away but never ignored.</p>\n<p>You can breathe both air and water and gain a Swim Speed of 20 feet.</p>\n<p><em>Applied automatically:</em> a swim Speed of 20 feet, and you breathe water, so holding your breath underwater never starts.</p>",
